Let the app ask for more than 59.94 frames per second.

The negotiation described the display as 59.94 Hz and asked for at most 59.94 fps
(CStreamingClientConfig fields 4 and 5, desired_framerate_numerator/denominator in current
Steam). IHS_SessionConfig gains maxFramerate; 0 keeps 59.94, 120 asks for 120 (in 1/100 fps,
as before), for TVs with a 120 Hz panel.

